[{"step_title": "Uninstall My Photo Diary", "items": [{"desc": "Your photos and album files stay untouched in any case.<br><br>Removed are the container, the image and the folder <code>docker/MPD/data</code> — it holds accounts, settings, previews <b>and your location history</b>.<br><br><b>Your location data is already safe.</b> Every night MPD places a copy in your own photo folder, in the subfolder <code>.mpd-keep</code> — it stays there after this uninstall. The administrator's account also holds the keys and credentials.<br><br>To keep accounts and settings, copy <code>docker/MPD/data</code> away first and put it back after reinstalling."}]}]
